# OpenFOAM's working files (meshes, saved fields, the processors' folders,
# logs, start.json while a level runs) stay out of the repository; the
# records are kept, each written once when its level finishes: per level
# record.json (which carries start.json's contents), monitor.csv and wall.csv.
*/L*/*
!*/L*/record.json
!*/L*/monitor.csv
!*/L*/wall.csv
.lock
*/.lock
